From: irregularthanis <343663069+irregularthanis@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 10:30:34 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 221/221] Aurora: edge smoothing (FXAA or SMAA) after the
 effects, before the HUD, opt-in (RecompCore #69, as merged)

RecompCore #69 as it was merged into the 0.13.0 re-cut batch (codex/0.13.0-batch-2, d733290f), in one patch: its 4 commits.

- 7ebb6b501e Aurora: edge smoothing (FXAA) after the effects, before the HUD (opt-in)
- 9b27cb3507 Aurora: SMAA as a second edge smoothing method; one mode for both
- 76864ad1cc Aurora backend: DOL_AURORA_MSAA=4 draws with 4 samples per pixel (probe)
- 943ecae277 Aurora: under MSAA, EFB depth copies and the depth peek read a single-sample depth
